I left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the fetch would need `aap:caps/http-client`, which isn't granted. Sending the item's text to an external host would also be a data path the node isn't authorised to use. If you want enrichment, put it in a separate node whose `with` clause grants `http-client` with an allowlist that covers `metadata.internal.example`.

